,"translationEn":"","translationId":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah mencurahkan air (dari langit) dengan berlimpah.","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":26,"numberInQuran":5784,"textArabic":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا الْاَرْضَ شَقًّاۙ","textLatin":"Ṡumma syaqaqnal-arḍa syaqqā(n).","translationEn":"","translationId":"Kemudian, Kami belah bumi dengan sebaik-baiknya.","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":27,"numberInQuran":5785,"textArabic":"فَاَنْۢبَتْنَا فِيْهَا حَبًّاۙ","textLatin":"Fa'ambatnā fīhā ḥabbā(n).","translationEn":"","translationId":"Lalu, Kami tumbuhkan padanya biji-bijian,","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":28,"numberInQuran":5786,"textArabic":"وَّعِنَبًا وَّقَضْبًاۙ","textLatin":"Wa ‘inabaw wa qaḍbā(n).","translationEn":"","translationId":"anggur, sayur-sayuran,","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":29,"numberInQuran":5787,"textArabic":"وَّزَيْتُوْنًا وَّنَخْلًاۙ","textLatin":"Wa zaitūnaw wa nakhlā(n).","translationEn":"","translationId":"zaitun, pohon kurma,","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":30,"numberInQuran":5788,"textArabic":"وَّحَدَاۤىِٕقَ غُلْبًا","textLatin":"Wa ḥadā'iqa gulbā(n).","translationEn":"","translationId":"kebun-kebun (yang) rindang,","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":31,"numberInQuran":5789,"textArabic":"وَفَاكِهَةً وَّاَبًّا","textLatin":"Wa fākihataw wa abbā(n).","translationEn":"","translationId":"buah-buahan, dan rerumputan.","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":32,"numberInQuran":5790,"textArabic":"مَتَاعًا لَّكُمْ وَلِاَنْعَامِكُمْۗ","textLatin":"Matā‘al lakum wa li'an‘āmikum.","translationEn":"","translationId":"(Semua itu disediakan) untuk kesenanganmu dan hewan-hewan ternakmu.","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":33,"numberInQuran":5791,"textArabic":"فَاِذَا جَاۤءَتِ الصَّاۤخَّةُ ۖ","textLatin":"Fa iżā jā'atiṣ-ṣākhkhah(tu).","translationEn":"","translationId":"Maka, apabila datang suara yang memekakkan (dari tiupan sangkakala),","tafsirId":"","juz":30},{"numberInSurah":34,"numberInQuran":5792,"text